{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21019","headline":"五粒小松歌 · 李贺","name":"五粒小松歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛇子蛇孙鳞蜿蜿，新香几粒洪厓饭。\n绿波浸叶满浓光，细束龙髯铰刀剪。\n主人壁上铺州图，主人堂前多俗儒。\n月明白露秋泪滴，石笋溪云肯寄书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}